      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1896-10-31_WidnesExaminer_art0001" n="art0001">
        <head>ENVELOPES FROM 2S. PER 15000• JOHN WALKER &amp; CO.,</head>
        <p>ENVELOPES FROM 2S. PER 15000• JOHN WALKER &amp; CO.,</p>
        <p>"EXAMINER" OFFICE. WARRINGTON.</p>
        <p>REGIST ERED FOR ISSION OAD,</p>
