        <p>The Plans and SpeAficatious may be inspectod at my aline 71, nigh Street,ktuncorn,on and after the 16t h day of Novem- ber, 1896, mad copies of the Specitiostion Schedule and form of Tender may be obtained on depo .it of 103. 6d., which will be returned on receipt of a bona fide Tender. boiled Tenders endorsed 'Tender for S.utten Water Works," to be delivered at my office not later than the 28th day of November, 1896.</p>
        <p>The Council no not bind themselves to accept the low9st or any Tender.</p>
