        <p>RO Vv". ANDS' ODONTO i the best and eafest dentifrice which can be used, as it contains no acid, mineral or gritty ngredients ;it whitens the teeth, prevents and arrests decay and sweetens the breath, 2s. 9d. per box, Sld by Chemists, Perfumers and Stores ; can be sent post free by A. ROWLAND Sons. 20, Hatton Garden, London, on receipt of advertise prices in postal order.</p>
